@startuml 13-discovery-sequence
!include _sequence.iuml
title Discovery — the sources found for the interests of a profile

participant "profileService\n(signup, profile saved,\nfind again)" as Profile
participant discoveryService as Discovery
participant profileModel as ProfileModel
participant "sourceService\n+ feedbackService" as Known
participant googleNews as Google
participant mediaCloud as MC
participant "feedFinder\n+ meaningJudge" as Finder
participant ingestService as Ingest
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Profile -> Discovery : start(userId)
Discovery -> ProfileModel : setDiscovery('running')
Discovery -->> Profile : returns at once
note over Discovery
    Asked again while it runs, it runs once
    more after, with the profile as it is then
end note

Discovery -> Discovery : prune: the feeds found that bring\nnothing on the profile any more, removed
Discovery -> ProfileModel : interestsForDiscovery, get
Discovery -> DB : the feeds of the reader, how many for the profile
note right of Discovery
    The room of the profile full: no medium
    is looked for, only the Google News
    searches of the reader are read
end note
Discovery -> Known : the media known and refused
note right : only new media are looked for
Discovery -> Discovery : judgeOf(the vectors of the interests)

loop each interest
    Discovery ->> MC : mediaFor(each search, language)
    note right of MC
        asked at once: its queue waits
        (2 searches a minute) while Google
        is tried. Every word (AND), 30 days,
        the press of the countries
    end note
    loop each search of the interest
        Discovery -> Google : search(q, 7 days, language)
        Google --> Discovery : the media that wrote on it
    end
    loop the new media of Google, per language: 2 kept, 5 tried at most
        Discovery -> Finder : findFeeds(site, subject, judge)
        Finder -> Finder : the page, the sections, the directory,\nRSS-Bridge; the news judged by meaning
        Finder --> Discovery : its feed on the subject, or none
    end
    MC -->> Discovery : the press media and their news
    loop the media of Media Cloud Google did not name: 2 kept, 3 tried
        Discovery -> MC : knownFeeds(site)
        Discovery -> Finder : findFeeds(site, subject, judge, known)
    end
end

Discovery -> Discovery : allocate among the interests,\nwithinBridgeRoom
Discovery -> ProfileModel : addProfileFeeds(feeds)
ProfileModel -> DB : user_feeds, origin 'profile'
Discovery -> Ingest : run({urls: the new feeds +\nthe Google News searches of the reader})
note right of Ingest
    read and embedded at once:
    the next briefing has them
end note
alt done
    Discovery -> ProfileModel : setDiscovery('done')
else an error
    Discovery -> ProfileModel : setDiscovery('failed', message)
end
@enduml
